   "widgets_values": [
    "Korean webtoon panel, medium shot.\n\nACTING (strong, instantly readable webtoon expression and body language): Jiyu (left) hugs her cushion and leans toward Daeun beside her (frame right), eyes squeezed into amused crescents, laughing with her mouth wide open. Daeun (center) flings both arms up at the ceiling and throws her head back against the sofa, eyebrows twisted up in exaggerated anguish, eyes screwed shut, mouth stretched wide in a long theatrical wail. Serin (right) holds her beer can and gives Daeun a flat sideways stare from heavy half-lidded eyes, one eyebrow cocked, mouth pressed into an unimpressed straight line.\n\nThe three sit side by side on the big sofa at night with snacks and beer on the table: Jiyu (the person in <image2>) (left) hugs a cushion with an amused smile, Daeun (the person in <image3>) (center) throws both arms up whining dramatically, Serin (the person in <image4>) (right) holds a beer can with a deadpan face. SPACE (identical in every panel of this scene): The dorm living room at night. The big cream sofa is in the middle with the floor-to-ceiling window and the city night view behind it; the TV hangs on the RIGHT wall facing the sofa; the hallway entrance is at the back RIGHT. On the sofa from left to right: Jiyu, Daeun, Serin; Harin lounges on the RIGHT end of the sofa; Eunsol sits on the LEFT armrest; Ria works out on the rug in front; Seola sits on the floor by the window on the LEFT; Seoha comes in from the hallway on the RIGHT.\n\nHan Jiyu (23, LUNARIS main vocal) wears: pink satin long-sleeve pajama set with long pants. Oh Daeun (21, LUNARIS sub-vocal) wears: yellow oversized hoodie, long pajama pants, fuzzy socks. Cha Serin (22, LUNARIS rapper) wears: plain black oversized t-shirt, gray sweatpants.\n\nExactly 3 people in the panel, each appearing only once.\n\nREFERENCES: <image1> is the location: draw the panel inside this same place with the same furniture, colors and lighting. <image2> is Han Jiyu (23, LUNARIS main vocal)'s neutral bust portrait (identity only: same face, eyes, hairstyle and hair color). <image3> is Oh Daeun (21, LUNARIS sub-vocal)'s face with the expression to act in this panel (teary-eyed whining with arms up): give Oh Daeun (21, LUNARIS sub-vocal) this exact facial expression (eyebrows, eyelids, eyes, mouth, tears, blush) and the same face and hair, but not its crop, background or outfit. <image4> is Cha Serin (22, LUNARIS rapper)'s face with the expression to act in this panel (unimpressed stare): give Cha Serin (22, LUNARIS rapper) this exact facial expression (eyebrows, eyelids, eyes, mouth, tears, blush) and the same face and hair, but not its crop, background or outfit. The person references only show who each person is. Do NOT copy their crop, plain background, outfit, pose or expression.\n\nART STYLE (identical in every image): high-quality anime key-visual style adapted for a glamorous Korean idol webtoon. Thin, clean, dark lineart with delicate hand-drawn weight variation. Soft cel shading with smooth gradient shadows; bright pastel idol-photoshoot colors with warm pink-peach key light, a soft rim light and a gentle glossy sheen on lips, skin and hair; subtle paper grain. Eyes: glossy anime eyes with layered iris gradients and fine lashes but adult almond eye shapes (never round childlike eyes). Hair: luminous highlight bands and defined strand clumps. Light diagonal hatching blush only when flustered. Adult faces with mature jawlines, realistic adult proportions, women slender with a natural medium-size chest. Not chibi, not 3D, not photorealistic, no plastic skin, no thick outlines, no text.\n\nOne single panel: no text, no speech bubbles, no sound effects, no panel border. Adults with realistic proportions. Taesik always wears his thick black-framed glasses unless told otherwise. The LUNARIS members are glamorous but never revealing.",
